{"4828390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Forsaken Fleet", "steam_appid": 4828390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The sea remembers.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/extras/684ac037a9a81913fb6a9a4b6518b26c.poster.avif?t=1788091708\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/extras/684ac037a9a81913fb6a9a4b6518b26c.webm?t=1788091708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/extras/684ac037a9a81913fb6a9a4b6518b26c.mp4?t=1788091708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <strong><u>Forsaken Fleet</u></strong> - After losing his son, an old fisherman lives alone on a remote coast. Strange clues lead him to a mysterious compass and a pirate legend that promises one last living memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Follow the compass</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It reveals what is hidden, even if some things were never meant to be found. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/extras/ee7df16efe59ed5666e17ef3c2e3c48b.poster.avif?t=1788091708\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/extras/ee7df16efe59ed5666e17ef3c2e3c48b.webm?t=1788091708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/extras/ee7df16efe59ed5666e17ef3c2e3c48b.mp4?t=1788091708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore forgotten places</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search abandoned places and follow the legend deeper into the dark.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/extras/89685a5b5da59e92faa962d26c38fc46.poster.avif?t=1788091708\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/extras/89685a5b5da59e92faa962d26c38fc46.webm?t=1788091708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/extras/89685a5b5da59e92faa962d26c38fc46.mp4?t=1788091708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face what the sea returned</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dead fleet is not only a legend.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/extras/66bf5674a5a304eaa842f2fe0fc07e01.poster.avif?t=1788091708\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/extras/66bf5674a5a304eaa842f2fe0fc07e01.webm?t=1788091708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/extras/66bf5674a5a304eaa842f2fe0fc07e01.mp4?t=1788091708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a fisherman drawn into a dark pirate legend. Follow a mysterious compass, sail through the fog and explore forgotten places. Search for clues, investigate abandoned locations and survive disturbing encounters as the legend of the Forsaken Fleet slowly becomes real.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;The deeper you follow the legend, the less the world feels real.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person psychological pirate horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sailing through foggy waters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration guided by a mysterious compass</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story focused discovery through clues and forgotten places</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric sound design and growing tension</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>WARNING:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epileptic seizures associated with increased sensitivity to light are Possible. Some people may experience seizures when exposed to flashes of light and flashing images that appear in a video game. People who have not previously experienced such attacks may not be aware of their illness. A reasonable restriction of the game audience is recommended.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The sea remembers.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/extras/684ac037a9a81913fb6a9a4b6518b26c.poster.avif?t=1788091708\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/extras/684ac037a9a81913fb6a9a4b6518b26c.webm?t=1788091708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/extras/684ac037a9a81913fb6a9a4b6518b26c.mp4?t=1788091708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <strong><u>Forsaken Fleet</u></strong> - After losing his son, an old fisherman lives alone on a remote coast. Strange clues lead him to a mysterious compass and a pirate legend that promises one last living memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Follow the compass</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It reveals what is hidden, even if some things were never meant to be found. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/extras/ee7df16efe59ed5666e17ef3c2e3c48b.poster.avif?t=1788091708\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/extras/ee7df16efe59ed5666e17ef3c2e3c48b.webm?t=1788091708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/extras/ee7df16efe59ed5666e17ef3c2e3c48b.mp4?t=1788091708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore forgotten places</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search abandoned places and follow the legend deeper into the dark.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/extras/89685a5b5da59e92faa962d26c38fc46.poster.avif?t=1788091708\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/extras/89685a5b5da59e92faa962d26c38fc46.webm?t=1788091708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/extras/89685a5b5da59e92faa962d26c38fc46.mp4?t=1788091708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face what the s