 light are Possible. Some people may experience seizures when exposed to flashes of light and flashing images that appear in a video game. People who have not previously experienced such attacks may not be aware of their illness. A reasonable restriction of the game audience is recommended.</p>", "short_description": "A first-person pirate horror where a haunted fisherman is drawn into the legend of the Forsaken Fleet. Follow a mysterious compass. Sail through the fog. Explore forgotten places and survive the horrors that should have stayed buried at sea.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Simplified Chinese, Czech, Slovak<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/665763a4c4100b072b247def937b3e5bf32b676a/header.jpg?t=1788091708", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/ce9e9fd960c8b33abe77bf717e7ba3a8b07095a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788091708", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828390/ce9e9fd960c8b33abe77bf717e7ba3a8b07095a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788091708", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 2600 or Intel Core i5-8400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 or AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 5700 or  Intel Core i5-11500<br></li><l